    "quick": "Synthesize the supplied interviews into traceable themes, tensions, buying evidence, implications, and open questions for {{company}}. Use optional Cookbook context: audience `{{audience}}`, positioning `{{positioning}}`, offer `{{offer}}`, proof `{{proof}}`, and constraints `{{constraints}}`. Separate participant evidence from interpretation and recommendation. Preserve exact meaning and label anything not directly supported as `Estimated`.",
